The data
--------
The published feed (the files under https://juicypasta.github.io/latecup-data/)
and the data files in this repository (overrides/, additions/, data/addresses.json)
are a database derived from OpenStreetMap and are made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

  © OpenStreetMap contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright)

data/nta2020.json is derived from the 2020 Neighborhood Tabulation Areas of the
NYC Department of City Planning (NYC Open Data), which are in the public domain.

The map styles (styles/) are made for the OpenMapTiles schema and OpenFreeMap's
tiles: © OpenFreeMap, © OpenMapTiles, data from OpenStreetMap.

